abstract: >-
  A teaching demo ({{SERIES_NAME_EN}}) of a controllable multi-agent workflow for short vertical comic dramas:
  one idea goes through 9 agents (idea, script, review/compliance, characters, storyboard, director board, art,
  compose, QC) that read and write one shared structured state. The browser version is an offline,
  deterministic port of the Python pipeline's mock mode (field-by-field identical output), with a live
  pipeline panel, a character-consistency matrix, cost presets with multi-model dispatch, and a 3D director
  stage. The Python version keeps adapters for local or cloud models.
